From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 15:02:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0258/3799] soh: rename func_800C016C -> Play_GetScreenPos

Name source: zeldaret/oot (same decomp, same ROM address).
Body verified against upstream at 0.94.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_play.c.
---
 soh/include/functions.h | 2 +-
 soh/src/code/z_kankyo.c | 2 +-
 soh/src/code/z_play.c   | 3 ++-
 3 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/include/functions.h b/soh/include/functions.h
index 789197dde..57dbf1327 100644
--- a/soh/include/functions.h
+++ b/soh/include/functions.h
@@ -1550,7 +1550,7 @@ s32 Play_InCsMode(PlayState* play);
